#: headsup_warnings/properties.py:71
msgid "'Affect only Origins/Locations/Parents’ is active in your 3D Viewport.  ▶▶▶ Go to the 3D Viewport → Right Sidebar → Tool → Options → Transform → Affect"
msgstr "“仅影响原点/位置/父级”已在 3D 视图中启用。▶▶▶ 转到 3D 视图 → 右侧边栏 → 工具 → 选项 → 变换 → 影响"

#: headsup_warnings/properties.py:113
msgid "'Auto Merge Vertices’ is active in your 3d Viewport.  ▶▶▶ Go to the 3D Viewport → Right Sidebar → Tool → Options → Transform → ‘Auto Merge’"
msgstr "“自动合并顶点”已在 3D 视图中启用。▶▶▶ 转到 3D 视图 → 右侧边栏 → 工具 → 选项 → 变换 → “自动合并”"

