#: headsup_warnings/properties.py:131
msgid "'Correct Face Attributes’ is turned on. Changing the Geometry will change the UV Layout. ▶▶▶ Go to the 3D Viewport → Right Sidebar → Tool → Options → Correct Face Attributes"
msgstr "“正确面属性”已开启。更改几何体将更改 UV 布局。▶▶▶ 转到 3D 视图 → 右侧边栏 → 工具 → 选项 → 正确面属性"

#: headsup_warnings/properties.py:155
msgid "'Local View’ is activated in one of your 3D Viewports. ▶▶▶ Press Numpad Slash (/) or go to the View menu in the 3D Viewport and select Local View → Toggle Local View"
msgstr "“局部视图”已在某个 3D 视图中启用。▶▶▶ 按小键盘斜杠 (/) 或转到 3D 视图的视图菜单，选择局部视图 → 切换局部视图"

#: headsup_warnings/properties.py:41
msgid "'Lock Camera To View’ is active in one of your 3D Viewports. This setting might destructively change your camera position and might not be undone. ▶▶▶ Disable via 3D Viewports Right Sidebar → View → Lock → Camera To View"
msgstr "“锁定相机到视图”已在某个 3D 视图中启用。此设置可能会以破坏性方式更改相机位置，且可能无法撤销。▶▶▶ 通过 3D 视图右侧边栏 → 视图 → 锁定 → 相机到视图 禁用"

#: headsup_warnings/properties.py:119
msgid "'UV Sync Selection’ is turned on, you are only seeing UV for selected Geometry. Watch out for hidden Geometry. ▶▶▶ Consider disabling ‘UV Sync Selection’ in the UV Editor Top Bar or check if there is Geometry to unhide in the Edit-Mode (Alt+H)"
msgstr "“UV 同步选择”已开启，你只会看到选中几何体的 UV。注意隐藏的几何体。▶▶▶ 考虑在 UV 编辑器顶栏中禁用“UV 同步选择”，或检查编辑模式中是否有可取消隐藏的几何体 (Alt+H)"

